        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "E7AD0FEE0DEEEFA2",
      "text": "¡Alola a todos! Venga, empecemos.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "E7AD0EEE0DEEEDEF",
      "text": "Parece que tenemos alguna que otra cara nueva\\nhoy, cómo me alegro.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "E7AD0DEE0DEEEC3C",
      "text": "Aquí, en el Área Costera, hemos recreado\\nartificialmente el entorno de una isla tropical.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "E7AD0CEE0DEEEA89",
      "text": "Hay una gran variedad de Pokémon adaptados\\na entornos de clima cálido viviendo en esta área.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "E7AD0BEE0DEEE8D6",
      "text": "Por ejemplo, al recibir más luz de lo normal,\\nes posible encontrar una especie con un tamaño\\r\\nmayor al que tiene en otras regiones.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "E7AD0AEE0DEEE723",
      "text": "¡Como lo oís! El aspecto de ciertos Pokémon\\ncambia según en qué región se encuentren.\\r\\nEs lo que llamamos[VAR 0xFF00(0006)] formas regionales[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "E7AD09EE0DEEE570",
      "text": "Vuestra tarea de hoy consistirá en capturar la\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Forma de Alola[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] de algún Pokémon.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "E7AD18EE0DEEFEED",
      "text": "Poneos a ello y venid a enseñármelo cuando lo\\nhayáis conseguido.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "E7AD17EE0DEEFD3A",
      "text": "¡Suerte!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "6A30E8939BD6607F",
      "text": "En nuestra academia tenemos muchas clases\\nprácticas como esta.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_fairybb_06",
      "hash64": "6A30E9939BD66232",
      "text": "¡A ver qué te parece! ¡Ánimo![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0070_fairybb_07",
      "hash64": "6A30EA939BD663E5",
      "text": "¿Sabes lo que tienes que buscar?\\c\\nSi ves un Exeggutor con un cuello muuuy largo,\\nes el ejemplo perfecto de una Forma de Alola.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
